# BuildKit's per-Dockerfile ignore: it applies when the build names this
# Dockerfile (-f scripts/stix/platform/Dockerfile), and its patterns are
# relative to the context root, the repo root.
#
# The build tree and the VCS never enter the context.
.git
build*/
#
# The controller's run dirs, should one ever sit in the tree: never ship
# a flash or run data (D-PLl). NOT *.bin: that would drop pc-bios/*.bin,
# and the meson setup lists them even with --disable-install-blobs
# (pc-bios/meson.build:95-97), so configure fails on the missing files.
**/flash.bin
**/uart.raw
**/qemu.log
**/log.jsonl*
**/tm.jsonl
**/qmp.sock
**/.stixplat-*
**/__pycache__/
